&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Platform Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos du rôle et de l&#39;équipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platform Engineering (CPE)&lt;/strong&gt; est une Business Unit de près de 200 personnes qui continue de se renforcer pour accompagner les ambitions tech de Decathlon. Notre objectif principal est de rationaliser le catalogue de produits techniques et de fournir des services clé en main pour les équipes IT, afin de leur permettre de se concentrer sur le développement de fonctionnalités à fort impact applicatif.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de la CPE, tu rejoindras l&#39;équipe &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Dev&lt;/strong&gt;. Notre mission est de fournir des fonctionnalités essentielles et abstraites pour le Cloud, en appliquant les meilleures pratiques de développement d&#39;ingénierie logicielle pour unifier, sécuriser et optimiser nos plateformes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu rejoindras une équipe à taille humaine, composée d&#39;ingénieurs passionnés. Nous sommes fans de développement logiciel, d&#39;Infrastructure as Code, de culture DevOps/SRE, d&#39;automatisation, de veille technologique... et bien sûr, de sport !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Périmètre et missions d&#39;un Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, tu joueras un rôle central dans l&#39;autonomisation des équipes de développement grâce à l&#39;ingénierie de plateforme. Tes missions s&#39;articuleront autour des piliers suivants :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Ingénierie Logicielle &amp;amp; Abstraction Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser les meilleures pratiques de développement (Software Engineering, Software Architecture) pour concevoir du code propre, robuste et maintenable créant des couches d&#39;abstraction au-dessus du Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et industrialiser des API, outils internes et modules d&#39;infrastructure en Python et Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consommer et orchestrer des services Serverless (Google Cloud Functions, Google Workflows) et moderniser l&#39;outillage de déploiement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Infrastructure as Code &amp;amp; Automatisation DevSecOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir, tester et déployer l&#39;infrastructure de manière cohérente et automatisée avec Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire et optimiser des pipelines CI/CD modernes (de préférence avec GitHub Actions) intégrant les standards de sécurité DevSecOps dès la conception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatiser les tâches récurrentes par du scripting (Python, Bash) afin de réduire l&#39;effort manuel et maximiser la fiabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Intégration Transversale &amp;amp; Excellence Opérationnelle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes Réseau, Sécurité et Bases de données pour garantir des intégrations fluides, performantes et sécurisées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rôle de Run Captain: prendre en charge le support de niveau 2/3, l&#39;analyse des incidents et le traitement des demandes de service pour assurer la stabilité opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la définition et au respect des SLO/SLI ainsi qu&#39;à la démarche de réduction du MTTR en automatisant la résolution des problèmes récurrents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Accompagnement, Partage &amp;amp; Culture Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger une documentation technique propre et des guides utilisateurs pour faciliter l&#39;adoption des services de plateforme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensibiliser et former les équipes techniques aux bonnes pratiques d&#39;utilisation des composants développés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l&#39;animation collective via la gestion agile de nos livrables dans JIRA et promouvoir le partage de connaissances au sein de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce dont tu auras besoin pour réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Dév :&lt;/strong&gt; Au moins 3 ans d&#39;expérience en développement Python avec une solide maîtrise des pratiques modernes de génie logiciel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Cloud :&lt;/strong&gt; Fortes compétences et expérience avérée sur Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code &amp;amp; CI/CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise de Terraform et très bonne pratique des pipelines CI/CD (idéalement GitHub Actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; Serverless :&lt;/strong&gt; Bonne connaissance de l&#39;automatisation (Python, Bash) et de l&#39;architecture Serverless / événementielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Esprit d&#39;équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent relationnel, fort sens de la satisfaction client/utilisateur interne, rigueur dans la documentation et aisance pour résoudre des problèmes complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Anglais maîtrisé à l&#39;oral comme à l&#39;écrit, niveau B2 minimum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un plus apprécié :&lt;/strong&gt; Connaissance pour le langage Go, l&#39;utilisation de Google Workflows ou une certification GCP (Associate Cloud Engineer ou Professional Cloud Developer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe &amp;amp; Sport :&lt;/strong&gt; Une communauté sportive passionnée et du temps dédié à la pratique du sport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadre de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital à Paris ou Lille et 2 jours de télétravail par semaine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Du matériel récent en accord avec tes missions et tes besoins techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunités &amp;amp; Mobilité :&lt;/strong&gt; Une équipe locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial, offrant des possibilités de carrière à l&#39;international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement professionnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Accompagnement continu dans le développement de tes compétences (diversité des projets, certifications, formations internes et externes…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package de rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package attractif incluant la participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise ainsi que des bonus mensuels, trimestriels et annuels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At OpenUp, we believe mental well-being should be as accessible and normal as going to the gym. Our mission is simple but ambitious: to make mental well-being available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We partner with companies to support their employees and families through proactive, practical mental health services. Our platform brings together 1:1 check-ins, courses, content, group sessions, and mindfulness practices - all supported by a dedicated network of experts. We take a holistic view, connecting mental and physical well-being through lifestyle coaching focused on sleep, nutrition, and exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we support over 1,500 companies and 500,000+ employees globally, including Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonald’s. Recognised as a Top 3 LinkedIn Startup in 2023, 2024 and 2025 - and we&#39;ve got big plans to keep growing our client-base, which is where this role comes into play.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re growing our presence in the DACH market and are looking for entrepreneurial, purpose-driven Account Executives to help build this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you own the full sales cycle end-to-end - from identifying opportunities and opening conversations, through to closing deals and building long-term relationships. This is not a “plug-and-play” sales role; it’s an opportunity to shape how we grow in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business by identifying and engaging potential clients across the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand a strong network of B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing accounts by spotting expansion opportunities (including international rollouts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted first point of contact for your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you’re energised by conversations, building relationships, and connecting with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You’re comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Mental well-being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales (ideally B2B SaaS or high-growth environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills - you’re a natural, confident and engaging networker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience - or interest - in building a network within HR or People teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in closing deals with medium- to large-enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, action-oriented way of working and a relationship-focussed sales approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for working in a highly dynamic, AI-forward international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Salesforce, HubSpot, or Pipedrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent language skills in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get as part of our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join a company that combines commercial ambition with meaningful impact. We move fast, support each other, and make time to celebrate along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary and bonus structure, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to your ClassPass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 monthly internet/phone allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy, vegetarian lunch at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular yoga, meditation, and breathing sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks, summer events, ski trips, and padel tournaments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access to OpenUp for you and your family, including sessions with psychologists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to be part of OpenUp? We’d love to hear your story. Apply via our website and we’ll get in touch soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://openup.com/nl/veelgestelde-vragen/&quot;&gt;FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; or reach out directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, everyone is welcome to apply regardless of age, gender, background, nationality, or any other characteristic. What matters to us is high performance, a real drive to make an impact and the ambition to become the European market leader. If you&#39;re ready to OpenUp, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to streamline parts of our recruitment process. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgement. All hiring decisions are made by humans. If you would like more information about how we use AI in the process, please contact us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Client Value Partner&lt;/strong&gt; role is a key addition to our broader Value Engineering team and will play a crucial role in Celonis’ growth strategy. As a CVP, you will spearhead our mission of data-driven business transformation with our most strategic customers. You will lead extensive teams of Celonis experts to ensure the success and satisfaction of some of our top customer base on their journey to realizing value with Celonis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP is the accountable lead for customer success, acting as the trusted advisor for a strategic customer. This involves engaging with C-Level Executives to collaboratively define the long-term vision for utilizing Celonis to transform their business while mobilizing the necessary Celonis resources. In collaboration with our cross-functional Celonis teams, you will drive measurable business impact across various processes and industries and accelerate the adoption of our platform.&amp;nbsp; The CVP will also champion transformational initiatives across Celonis and customer accounts, fostering innovation and strategic change to maximize value and drive business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek experienced professionals with a proven track record in managing executive relationships, driving profitable growth, and blending industry expertise with strong analytical and consulting skills. Join us at the forefront of one of the fastest-growing tech companies worldwide and help guide our customers to become the next Lighthouse Celonis customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountable Program Lead &amp;amp; Engagement Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including C-level internal / external executives, embedding Celonis into their strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure engagements are properly staffed leveraging resources from global cross-functional Celonis teams, such as Servicing, Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor customer on organization design and maturation of Centers of Excellence to focus on increasing adoption of our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach team members, providing guidance and support for their success, and offer feedback to managers on team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Customer Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the end-to-end customer value journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence key customer stakeholders through executive communication, product knowledge, and industry/domain expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior stakeholders to establish the Celonis program roadmap and detailed value plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve customer escalations orchestrating internal teams efficiently and effectively in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internalize the customer&#39;s strategy and targets and drive Celonis delivery alignment to that strategy, ensuring that we support the customer in solving business-critical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive value realization and adoption within accounts, ensuring high-quality, on-time project completion, client satisfaction, and meeting usage and adoption targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Builder and Customer Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and lead customer advisory boards to address industry-specific challenges and innovations, establishing a structured feedback loop to continuously gather insights and improve products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of the customer within the company, ensuring alignment of product development and service offerings with industry needs and customer feedback, while collaborating with the customer advocacy team on advocacy strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer presence and sponsorship at key Celonis and industry events, serving as a Celonis leader at conferences, webinars, and through published thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on innovation or new asset development in specific domains, and contribute to playbooks, resources, and tools for the value engineering team to enhance their effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 10 years of relevant strategy consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in driving large scale transformation programs, process re-engineering engagements, and implementations within supply chain and/or manufacturing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-based transformation is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep exposure to and experience with successful change management practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate large global organizations and have the power of persuasion through data, facts and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to successfully work with internal resources to design, pitch and sell opportunities with relevant subject matter experts and practice leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a natural and consultative approach when engaging with senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player who inspires the team with a patient and entrepreneurial leadership style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management: ability to organize and manage multiple streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated, proactive team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to thrive in fast-paced, collaborative, and ambiguous environments with various stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Total compensation package will include base salary + bonus + equity + benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
