&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI/ML :&lt;/strong&gt; Frameworks d&#39;orchestration d&#39;agents (LangGraph, CrewAI, Autogen), LLMs (OpenAI, Claude, Mistral), Vector Databases.&lt;/p&gt;
